.inc CoilcraftTemplates.lib

*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 1008HQ-3N0
* Inductance = 3nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-14.1GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 1008HQ-3N0 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.052pF Ind=3nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=7
+ R2=0.04
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.0000076
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 1008HQ-3N0

